WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:05.390
Hello and welcome, I'm Mariam and thank you
for taking the time to visit my website.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:10.670
For the past two years, I've been working in
the iGaming industry as a game show host.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:16.430
Every day I communicate with hundreds of players
from different countries — adapting quickly to

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:20.270
new situations and making sure every
interaction is a positive one.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.610
As I started thinking about the next step in
my career, I also invested my time in

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:30.850
developing new skills by completing customer
support courses, including Intercom and

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:34.270
Zendesk. I'm always looking for
opportunities to learn and grow.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.370
Now I'm excited to move into customer support,
customer success, operations, or player experience.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:44.270
I enjoy working with people, solving problems
and being part of a team, and I would

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.070
love to continue building my career
in the iGaming industry.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:52.670
Feel free to explore my website to learn
more about my experience, skills and

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:58.990
certifications. Thank you for watching —
I look forward to connecting with you.
